WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.391
KATY
Who are you?

00:00:09.008 --> 00:00:11.160
SHANG-CHI
I'm not who you think I am.

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:14.338
KEVIN FEIGE
We're going back to the very beginning

00:00:14.388 --> 00:00:16.698
of the MCU.
We have a keystone event

00:00:16.748 --> 00:00:19.960
and that event is
Tony Stark becoming Iron Man.

00:00:20.623 --> 00:00:24.224
He's forced to build
these weapons for an organization,

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:26.801
and that organization
was the Ten Rings.

00:00:30.806 --> 00:00:32.607
KEVIN FEIGE
And there was this wonderful character

00:00:32.657 --> 00:00:34.245
that we really wanted to do
something with someday,

00:00:34.295 --> 00:00:35.559
and that was Shang-Chi.

00:00:36.177 --> 00:00:37.542
SIMU LIU
When they announced this movie,

00:00:37.592 --> 00:00:39.525
I was really, really excited.

00:00:41.537 --> 00:00:43.596
Kind of tongue-in-cheek,
I ended up tweeting Marvel,

00:00:43.646 --> 00:00:46.612
"Hey, are we gonna talk or what?"
I'm very glad I did that.

00:00:47.642 --> 00:00:50.783
AWKWAFINA
He's so intense as this character.

00:00:51.267 --> 00:00:53.396
Shang-Chi was made for Simu,

00:00:53.446 --> 00:00:55.317
and I could
feel his passion for it.

00:00:57.016 --> 00:00:59.849
KEVIN FEIGE
The backstory of Shang is really unique,

00:00:59.899 --> 00:01:04.810
in that he discovered
that his father was this evil overlord.

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:07.633
WENWU
The rings gave our family power.

00:01:08.137 --> 00:01:09.964
SIMU LIU
He's brought back into his father's world

00:01:10.015 --> 00:01:12.953
and has to deal with coming
face to face with him again,

00:01:13.004 --> 00:01:16.183
and this is a much meaner
and more hardened father.

00:01:22.333 --> 00:01:25.875
And then crazy stuff
happens after that. [Laughing]

00:01:25.926 --> 00:01:27.486
WENWU
It's time for you to take your place

00:01:27.536 --> 00:01:28.635
by my side.

00:01:28.685 --> 00:01:29.977
SHANG-CHI
That's not gonna happen.

00:01:35.971 --> 00:01:37.971
DESTIN DANIEL CRETTON
My heart is definitely in this project.

00:01:38.021 --> 00:01:41.070
It feels in line with
everything I believe in,

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:44.835
and it is a crazy, wild, giant ride
that we are gonna go on.

00:01:44.885 --> 00:01:46.338
KATY
Hold on, everybody!

